{"id":"63efc31baadeeacc","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-prop-reflection.md","title":"Levy Reflection","display":"prop-reflection — Levy Reflection","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-reflection","aliases":["58-prop-reflection","Levy Reflection"],"display":"prop-reflection — Levy Reflection","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-absolute.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-reflection</span><span>Levy Reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-reflection — Levy Reflection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36b4649dd248921c\" href=\"?note=36b4649dd248921c\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md\">../batch02/58-df-absolute.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48306f486b6f0dda\" href=\"?note=48306f486b6f0dda\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\Sigma_\\in\\in V\">\\(\\Phi,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\Sigma_\\in\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\in\">\\(\\Sigma_\\in\\)</span> the pure membership signature.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\)</span> is the set of membership-language formula codes.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S\\)</span> type the ordinal indices and the stages <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\beta\">\\(V_\\beta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)\\)</span> is the set-to-set absoluteness predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36b4649dd248921c\" href=\"?note=36b4649dd248921c\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md\">../batch02/58-df-absolute.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\Phi)\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\n\\to \\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\land\n\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(V_\\beta,\\beta)\\land\n\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(V_\\gamma,\\gamma)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\Phi)\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\n\\to \\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\land\n\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(V_\\beta,\\beta)\\land\n\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(V_\\gamma,\\gamma)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every finite family of membership-language formulas has arbitrarily high pairs of rank-initial segments that agree simultaneously on assignments from the smaller stage.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is the set-coded consequence of Lévy reflection obtained by choosing two reflection points; it uses the exact upstream <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S\\)</span> predicate and never passes the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as an argument.</li>\n<li>Full first-order elementarity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\beta\\prec V\">\\(V_\\beta\\prec V\\)</span> is neither asserted nor obtained.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md","status":"resolved","id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-absolute.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md","status":"resolved","id":"48306f486b6f0dda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-cumulative-stage.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-absolute.md","status":"resolved","id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)$ is the set-to-set absoluteness predicate of [[../batch02/58-df-absolute.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\Sigma_\\in\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\Phi)\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\n\\to \\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\alpha<\\beta<\\gamma\\land\n\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(V_\\beta,\\beta)\\land\n\\mathrm{CumulativeStage}_S(V_\\gamma,\\gamma)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,V_\\beta,V_\\gamma)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\beta\\prec V","display":false}],"bytes":1956,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3989","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-prop-reflection.md|58-prop-reflection]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["36b4649dd248921c","48306f486b6f0dda","65418b505fc53093","5582a281f15a33c2","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}